<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH 96 STATE BUDGET DEFICIT CZK 1.6 BLN - FINMIN.</title>
<headline>CZECH 96 STATE BUDGET DEFICIT CZK 1.6 BLN - FINMIN.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech state budget ended 1996 with a deficit of 1.562 billion crowns, after posting a 7.2 billion crown surplus in 1995, the Finance Ministry said on Friday.  </p>
<p> CZECH STATE BUDGET	 FY 97     JAN-NOV 96     FY 95</p>
<p>  Revenue (CZK bln)	 482.8	 431.4	  440.0</p>
<p>  Expenditure		 484.3	 434.4	  432.8</p>
<p>  Balance		    -1.562	  -3.0	   +7.2</p>
<p>Note. The ministry said the results were definitive.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
